01:37:41.898 --> 01:37:42.358
The Uncles,

01:37:42.359 --> 01:37:43.019
I didn't know her.

01:37:43.039 --> 01:37:46.540
But I was still thinking about someone I loved.

01:37:47.804 --> 01:37:49.766
We experienced a period of absolute happiness.

01:37:50.206 --> 01:37:50.866
Ah, that's true.

01:37:51.707 --> 01:37:52.047
It's true.

01:37:52.407 --> 01:37:56.090
I read articles in the newspapers that referred to Audiard's gang,

01:37:56.791 --> 01:37:58.192
They are all behind Mireille.

01:37:58.193 --> 01:37:59.713
And it wasn't Audiard's gang,

01:37:59.733 --> 01:38:00.693
It was the gang with the other nose.

01:38:01.674 --> 01:38:03.375
And I say it was Mireille's gang.

